# florida-dc
#
# What is published here is the reverse engineering: hand-written bodies,
# evidence tables, docs and tools. Everything below is either a copy of the
# retail game, an analysis cache, or a build product, so none of it is uploaded.
# Directories are kept with a .gitkeep where the whole directory is ignored.

# --- retail game data: never distribute -----------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.pdb
*.rpf
*.ttpf
*.awc
*.bk2
*.xvd
*.xex
*.pkg
*.dmp
*.bin
*.sco
*.csc

# --- dumps taken from the executable --------------------------------------
*.strings.txt
*unicodestrings.txt
all_strings.txt
strings2.txt
rdata_strings.txt
out.txt

# --- generated tables ------------------------------------------------------
# The NID database is 154,478 rows of names; it is regenerated from the
# GhidraProspero extension by `tools/ps5nids.py export-db`, so the TSV is not
# tracked, only the small SDK-header table and the tool.
names/ps5_nid_db.tsv
tools/shadertool/shadertool
# ps_shader_dc trees are generated decompiler output (tens of MB per binary);
# ps_shader_dc/README.md and tools/DumpAll.java are the tracked parts.
ps_shader_dc/*/
# built test tool
src/file/rpf9_list

# --- keys and keyrings -----------------------------------------------------
# The archive key is project data, not source. tools/rpf9crypt.cpp and
# tools/rpf9keyhunt.cpp read it from here at run time; the repo ships the
# algorithm and the format, never a key. The directory keeps its README.
keys/*
!keys/README.md
!keys/.gitkeep
*.key
*.keyring

# --- Ghidra project and its exports ---------------------------------------
ghidra_proj/
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.lock

# --- raw decompiler output kept only for comparison ------------------------
attic/**
!attic/.gitkeep

# --- objdiff / clang-cl build products ------------------------------------
build/**
!build/.gitkeep
objdiff/
*.obj
*.o
*.so
*.a

# --- generated indexes (tools/reindex.py and tools/gen_objdiff.py rebuild them)
index.tsv
INDEX.md
objdiff.json

# --- tool caches ----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
target/
.cache/
